            "state": "translated",
            "value": "至少加入一種語言，讓 Cotabby 知道要使用哪種語言寫作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add models from your LM Studio library (~/.lmstudio/models) to the picker above. Downloads still save to Cotabby's own folder.": {
      "comment": "Used in: UI/Settings/Panes/Engine/EngineAndModelPaneView+OpenSource.swift",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "أضف نماذج من مكتبة LM Studio لديك (~/.lmstudio/models) إلى القائمة أعلاه. تظل التنزيلات محفوظة في مجلد Cotabby الخاص."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modelle aus deiner LM-Studio-Bibliothek (~/.lmstudio/models) zum obigen Auswahlfeld hinzufügen. Downloads werden weiterhin in Cotabbys eigenem Ordner gespeichert."
          }
        },
        "es": {
